#. module: deltatech_safety_register
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_deltatech_safety_register
msgid ""
"===============\n"
"Safety Register\n"
"===============\n"
"\n"
"..\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:6f17849f2aa404b30b3f58abcd6f8ec0d5669880378eb02bbcc81364c47cbe4e\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-dhongu%2Fdeltatech-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/dhongu/deltatech/tree/20.0/deltatech_safety_register\n"
"    :alt: dhongu/deltatech\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2|\n"
"\n"
"Register of safety events for companies that run safety or World Class\n"
"Manufacturing programmes: near misses, incidents and work accidents,\n"
"each with its root cause and corrective actions, and the safety\n"
"indicators of the year.\n"
"\n"
"**Key features:**\n"
"\n"
"- **Safety events** classified as Near miss, Incident (no injury),\n"
"  Injury (no time lost), Lost-time injury or Fatal, numbered\n"
"  ``SAF/<year>/NNNN``, with location, description and root cause.\n"
"- **Injured person**: an employee, a partner (contractor, visitor) or a\n"
"  free-text name; the employee department is filled in automatically.\n"
"- **Commuting accidents** (accident de traseu) are flagged, kept in the\n"
"  register and excluded from LTIFR.\n"
"- **Corrective actions** with responsible and deadline; each action\n"
"  schedules a To-Do activity for its responsible user. An event can be\n"
"  closed only after all its actions are done, and a closed event can be\n"
"  changed only by a Safety manager.\n"
"- **Indicators** per company and year: LTIFR (lost-time injuries x\n"
"  1,000,000 / hours worked, the hours coming from Attendances), number\n"
"  of near misses, lost-time injuries, commuting accidents and days\n"
"  without accident.\n"
"- Two access groups, Safety officer and Safety manager, with\n"
"  multi-company isolation.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Give the users the **Safety officer** or **Safety manager** access\n"
"   right (Settings → Users).\n"
"2. Go to **Safety → Events → New**, choose the type, date, location and\n"
"   describe the event. For an injury, select the injured employee,\n"
"   partner or type the name; tick *Commuting accident* when it happened\n"
"   on the way to or from work.\n"
"3. In the **Root cause** tab write the cause, then add the **Corrective\n"
"   actions** with responsible and deadline. Each responsible receives a\n"
"   To-Do activity.\n"
"4. Mark each action **Done** when it is completed, then press **Close**\n"
"   on the event.\n"
"5. Go to **Safety → Reporting → Indicators**, choose the year: LTIFR,\n"
"   near misses, lost-time injuries, commuting accidents and days without\n"
"   accident. LTIFR stays empty while a past month has no hours worked in\n"
"   Attendances; the missing months are listed.\n"
"6. To export the register, select the events in the list and use\n"
"   **Export** (XLSX).\n"
"\n"
"Changelog\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"20.0.1.0.0\n"
"----------\n"
"\n"
"- First version: safety events, corrective actions and indicators\n"
"  (LTIFR, near misses, days without accident).\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `Terrabit Issues <https://www.terrabit.ro/helpdesk>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* Terrabit\n"
"* Dorin Hongu\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
".. |maintainer-dhongu| image:: https://github.com/dhongu.png?size=40px\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/dhongu\n"
"    :alt: dhongu\n"
"\n"
"Current maintainer:\n"
"\n"
"|maintainer-dhongu| \n"
"\n"
"This module is part of the `dhongu/deltatech <https://github.com/dhongu/deltatech/tree/20.0/deltatech_safety_register>`_ project on GitHub.\n"
"\n"
"You are welcome to contribute."
